# Helm dependency vendoring (Plan 5 Task 2): Chart.lock is committed
# (exact pin), the fetched .tgz is regenerated by `helm dependency build`
# and not tracked. Unanchored (matches envs/prod/*/charts/*.tgz too, not
# just a repo-root charts/ dir -- verified: a bare `charts/*.tgz` here
# would only match at repo root per gitignore's relative-pattern rule).
**/charts/*.tgz
